  assumptions: Metres, Y-up, original horizontal mounting origin and normalized ground
    floor. Source Tree or Wood rigid assembly stays one opaque palette mesh; snowy
    variants have independently removable decorative SnowCap. Snow-free source variants
    are kept snow-free. Two shared materials across the set; no transparent foliage
    cards, wind animation, runtime assembly or plowable decorative snow. Upright
    trees have a narrow trunk capsule, stumps/logs have a compact box; collision
    shapes are review proposals. Existing 230 m DistanceVisibility is retained. Placement
    follows Terrain at the base; stumps/logs align with local terrain normal without
    deforming shared meshes.
  reviewNotes: Authorized prototype replacement. Needs visual collision/terrain review
    and A07 profiling before Ready publication.
